{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫戀綜《女神配對計劃 2》最近播出的一集，一眾女神與各自的求愛勇者大玩「二人三足版煮飯仔」慰勞親友，場面搞笑又熱鬧。</p><p>至於一大驚喜位，是與陳星妤（Yvette）「友達以上」、心大心細的李爾晨（Kyle），終於踏出勇敢的第一步奔向女神！</p><p>雖然話</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:04:28.759160+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:04:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:35.894288+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:35.894288+00:00","content_hash":"75fec40abe2df300ff02928efb1ccf034bd9f8be56ea78b92f8f68aed6686e9c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}